    <briefdescription>
<para>An output buffer is a vector of struct iovec for writev(). </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each iovec buffer is allocated using slab allocator. Buffer size grows by a factor of 2. <ref refid="structWith" kindref="compound">With</ref> this growth factor, the number of used buffers is unlikely to ever exceed the hard limit of SMALL_OBUF_IOV_MAX. If it does, an exception is raised. </para>    </detaileddescription>
